Abyss by Ilia Reingold (ShaderDesk)
https://github.com/ilrein/shaderdesk/blob/main/Scenes/Abyss.metal
(ported from blob 5363e12d8024cf0f7ae34564c6b04c4ff7547e65, last changed in commit
a9892e716a5a5ffe3835149e4a0f359f56e79cc2 of https://github.com/ilrein/shaderdesk)

Ported to Metal Shading Language for MacOS Live Wallpaper; see the note at the
top of main.metal for what was changed.


WHERE THE LICENCE IS STATED

The shader file has no licence line of its own. It was written for the
ShaderDesk repository, whose licence covers it:

  https://github.com/ilrein/shaderdesk/blob/main/LICENSE
